https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115185","id":3775234171,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7hBYB7","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-20T22:24:15Z","updated_at":"2026-01-20T22:24:15Z","body":"I don't reproduce that issue in 4.6.rc2 following the steps to reproduce. Tested on Fedora 43.\n\nI suspect this might be related to #107430 which I also can't reproduce. If so it's maybe not a regression in 4.6.rc2 but maybe just something that's a bit erratic?\n\nCC @YeldhamDev ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3775234171/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3775549866","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115185#issuecomment-3775549866","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115185","id":3775549866,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7hClGq","user":{"login":"matheusmdx","id":44306054,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzA2MDU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44306054?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx","html_url":"https://github.com/matheusmdx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-21T00:19:42Z","updated_at":"2026-01-21T00:23:21Z","body":"To reproduce the bug you need to create an animation in the `AnimationPlayer` node (which also will create the `[Global]` library), after that click on `Manage Animations` and fold the library animations, this will create the file `lib_folding.cfg` in `.godot\\editor`. Now every time you close this window with the `[Global]` library expanded, the error will be thrown (the amount of errors will be the amount of animations you have inside `[Global]`).\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1c9a51cf-e948-405a-878e-08252d669ddf\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\nThe error per-se comes from Godot 4.4 dev 6 from PR #86481 which added the library folding logic but seems to have a flaw (explained here: #109108). So what i suppose that happened was OP folded the library while editing the project which create the `lib_folding.cfg` and starts the bug. I cherry-picked #109108 in latest master and that fixed the issue.\n\n@sankingink A workaround while the fix is not merged you can delete the `lib_folding.cfg` file, that will keep the library always expanded. After that just don't fold the library to not create the mentioned file until the fix is merged.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3775549866/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3787845323","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115185#issuecomment-3787845323","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115185","id":3787845323,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7hxe7L","user":{"login":"ajselvig","id":455594,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1NTU5NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/455594?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajselvig","html_url":"https://github.com/ajselvig","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajselvig/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajselvig/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajselvig/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajselvig/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajselvig/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajselvig/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajselvig/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajselvig/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajselvig/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-23T02:34:20Z","updated_at":"2026-01-23T02:34:20Z","body":"FWIW, I landed here because I was experiencing the same spamming (although, in my case, around 3-4k times every time the Manage Library dialog opened, making it quite slow). The proposed workaround (deleting lib_folding.cfg) did indeed work. ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3787845323/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]